<title>UK: FAIRFIELD POSTS MODEST PREMIUM ON LSE DEBUT.</title>
<headline>FAIRFIELD POSTS MODEST PREMIUM ON LSE DEBUT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in printing machinery supplier Fairfield Enterprises Plc on Monday rose to a two percent premium on their first day of dealings on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Fairfield shares, issued at 115p, nudged up 2-1/2p to 117-1/2p by 1053 GMT in thin volume of 8,400 shares.</p>
</text>
